title: Piłsudski and the Army
subtitle: Curb his influence, win him over or give way to him: from the subordination of the army to an independent inspectorate.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_pils_agreement.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_security_rules && PolishSecurity.pilsCardAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.pils_agreement (Z — 1.02, the user's decisions of 7 XI 2026; technical reference 16.7, 16.8.1; card catalogue 8.15):
// five options from curbing the influence of Piłsudski to the independent inspectorate. An own initiative costs this month's
// action; the answer in the political crisis of a coup costs none. One agreement at a time; its relief comes once.
PolishSecurity.pilsView(Q);
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_pils_agreement');
!}

= Piłsudski and the army

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Piłsudski demands command of the army independent of the minister and the Sejm; his followers are in the army and in PPS. We can curb his influence, win him over or give way to him.

[+ pl_pils_line +]

- @subordinate
- @legion_cult
- @military_function
- @inspectorate
- @status_quo
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@subordinate
title: Subordinate the army to the minister and the Sejm
subtitle: Piłsudski loses his say in the nominations, and the army leans less towards him (−5 percentage points). The Piłsudczycy in PPS rebel (+10) and relations with Piłsudski worsen (−15). [? if pl_pils_subordinate_coalition : [+ pl_pils_subordinate_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.pilsOptionStatus(Q, 'subordinate').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pils_subordinate_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.pilsChoose(Q, 'subordinate');
!}
go-to: result

@legion_cult
title: Celebrate the deed of the Legions
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget unit. The anniversary of the march of the First Cadre Company and decorations for the legionnaires; relations with Piłsudski improve (+10).
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.pilsOptionStatus(Q, 'legion_cult').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pils_legion_cult_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.pilsChoose(Q, 'legion_cult');
!}
go-to: result

@military_function
title: Give Piłsudski a military function under civilian control
subtitle: Needs relations of at least 40. He gets a post, but the minister and the Sejm keep their oversight. The pressure towards a coup falls (−12), but the army leans a little more towards him (+3 percentage points).
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.pilsOptionStatus(Q, 'military_function').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pils_military_function_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.pilsChoose(Q, 'military_function');
!}
go-to: result

@inspectorate
title: Give Piłsudski an independent inspectorate of the army
subtitle: Needs relations of at least 60. Piłsudski commands the army and appoints its officers without the oversight of the minister and the Sejm. The pressure towards a coup falls sharply (−25), but the Centrum of PPS protests (+8), and the army leans more towards him (+5 percentage points). [? if pl_pils_inspectorate_coalition : [+ pl_pils_inspectorate_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.pilsOptionStatus(Q, 'inspectorate').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pils_inspectorate_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.pilsChoose(Q, 'inspectorate');
!}
go-to: result

@status_quo
title: Keep the present order in the army
subtitle: Costs nothing. The Centrum of PPS is content (−3), but Piłsudski feels passed over and relations with him worsen (−3).
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.pilsOptionStatus(Q, 'status_quo').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pils_status_quo_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.pilsChoose(Q, 'status_quo');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Piłsudski and the army

[+ pl_pils_result +]

- @root: Continue.
